"动作: Catchlight 取字   触发器: Meta+Shift+O   命令: catchlight ocr\n"
"动作: Catchlight 录制   触发器: Meta+Shift+R   命令: catchlight record --gif"
msgstr "# System Settings -> Shortcuts -> Custom Shortcuts -> New -> Command/URL\n"
"Action: Catchlight region    Trigger: Meta+Shift+S    Command: catchlight region\n"
"Action: Catchlight full      Trigger: Meta+Shift+F    Command: catchlight full\n"
"Action: Catchlight text      Trigger: Meta+Shift+O    Command: catchlight ocr\n"
"Action: Catchlight record    Trigger: Meta+Shift+R    Command: catchlight record --gif"

